@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043
# Sustituir mediante el gestor privado del cliente HTTP; nunca versionar tokens.
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@workshopId = synthetic-workshop
@stayId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Eventos del día actual; total exacto y salto de página.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lpr/events?workshopIds={{workshopId}}&pageNumber=2&pageSize=50&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Inválidas sin estancia, por texto original literal.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lpr/events?workshopIds={{workshopId}}&originalText=synthetic-invalid&plateStatus=invalid&association=unassigned
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Investigar recepción; el orden sigue por captura.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/lpr/events?workshopIds={{workshopId}}&fromDate=2026-11-19&throughDate=2026-11-19&timeBasis=receipt&confidenceMode=range&confidenceMin=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Estancias que coinciden con el período.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stays?workshopIds={{workshopId}}&fromDate=2026-11-19&throughDate=2026-11-19
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Presencia vigente, preparada incluso con cierre diario retrasado.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/present?workshopIds={{workshopId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recorrido exacto; Admin puede repetir workshopIds o no seleccionarlos.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/timeline?plate=0012BCD&workshopIds={{workshopId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Observaciones completas y paginadas de la identidad resuelta.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stays/{{stayId}}/observations?pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Excel de todas las coincidencias, sin paginación; máximo 10.000 filas.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/history/exports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "events",
  "filters": { "workshopIds": ["{{workshopId}}"], "plate": "012", "plateMatch": "contains" },
  "order": "asc"
}
